Package: ai2analytics
Type: Package
Title: Reusable Analytics Framework with Configurable Pipeline Templates
Version: 0.2.1
Authors@R: person("AI2Analytics", "Contributors", email = "noreply@example.com",
                   role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Native R port of the AI2Analytics Python framework. Provides
    reusable pipeline templates for entity segmentation and market mix
    modelling, plus a JSONL-backed knowledge store for accumulating
    decisions across runs. Each pipeline separates logic from data shape
    so the same template handles many similar datasets via configuration.
    The included demos use pharmaceutical promotional data because that
    is the author's domain, but the primitives are transportable across
    consumer goods, software, retail, financial services, and any other
    setting with panel-structured response data.
